    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Mohorovičić Discontinuity separates the Crust from the Mantle.",
        "Gutenberg Discontinuity marks the boundary between the Mantle and the Outer Core.",
        "S-waves cannot pass through liquid, proving that the Outer Core is liquid.",
        "Lehmann Discontinuity separates the liquid Outer Core from the solid Inner Core."
      ],
      "id": "81kszw6"
    },
    {
      "id": "6mwcjlu",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Important Discontinuities"
    },
    {
      "id": "mi6k52l",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
